{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":496593,"name":"diaoguoliang","username":"diaoguoliang","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/bcef8e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T04:56:17.153Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFeature request for product/service\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChat\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-describe-the-request-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-describe-the-request-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the request\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-english-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-english-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eEnglish\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-feature-request-for-productservice-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-feature-request-for-productservice-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFeature request for product/service\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-describe-the-request-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-describe-the-request-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the request\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease add \u003cstrong\u003eClear conversation\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003eNew chat\u003c/strong\u003e per Bot, while keeping the Bot (persona, skills, routines).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eToday the only documented way to wipe a transcript is sidebar right-click → Delete, which permanently destroys the Bot and its chat. Staff have mentioned “start a fresh chat” in other threads, but there is no clear UI control for it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy: users run many long-lived specialist Bots across projects and need a clean context without rebuilding the Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNice-to-haves: confirm dialog; optional archive of old transcript; optional toggle whether durable memory is cleared.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlatform: macOS Desktop Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-h-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-h-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e中文\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-h-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-h-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e产品/服务功能请求\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-h-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-h-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e请求描述\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e请为每个 Bot 增加 \u003cstrong\u003e清空对话\u003c/strong\u003e 或 \u003cstrong\u003e新建对话\u003c/strong\u003e 功能，同时保留 Bot（角色设定、技能和例程）。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e目前，文档中唯一明确的清除聊天记录方式是通过侧边栏右键菜单选择“删除”；但这会永久删除 Bot 及其聊天记录。工作人员在其他帖子中提到过“开始新的聊天”，但目前没有清晰的界面控件可以实现这一点。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e原因：用户会在多个项目中长期使用许多专用 Bot，需要在不重建 Bot 的情况下获得干净的上下文。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e可选增强：确认对话框；可选择归档旧聊天记录；可选择是否同时清除持久记忆。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e平台：macOS Desktop Grok Bot。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496593-operating-system-if-it-applies-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496593-operating-system-if-it-applies-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System (if it applies)\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T04:56:24.862Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":35.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172465,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-clear-chat-new-chat-without-deleting-the-bot-bot","display_username":"diaoguoliang","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_h